WEBVTT

00:16:28.151 --> 00:16:30.922
where you're going to learn
something about the universe,

00:16:30.946 --> 00:16:35.777
it could be that your reward system
is being so activated and so gratified

00:16:35.801 --> 00:16:37.300
by the rush of ideas

00:16:37.324 --> 00:16:41.337
that it overcomes whatever
discomfort is coming to you

00:16:41.361 --> 00:16:43.318
via excessive stimulation.

00:16:43.342 --> 00:16:46.904
But the other thing is that
we're talking here in generalities,

00:16:46.928 --> 00:16:48.999
but it really varies
from person to person.

00:16:49.023 --> 00:16:52.330
Some people tend to be
more sensitive to social stimulation,

00:16:52.354 --> 00:16:54.462
for some people, it's bright lights,

00:16:54.486 --> 00:16:55.973
for some people, it's sounds.

00:16:55.997 --> 00:16:58.428
It's not going to be
the same for everybody.

00:16:58.452 --> 00:17:01.503
Actually, in those experiments
that you were just talking about